Z||000015||Dave Gunsul||11-28-2001||12:16 AM||||I really appreciate all the compliments!!<P>The wheels are 15's. I went with those because I wanted lightweight rims to cut some weight off the car. The wheels only weigh 13 IB's and at the time they were the lightest wheel that I could find that would fit the Fiero.<BR>I've since found the SSR Competition rims that, even in a 16, are even lighter than these so i'm debating right now on whether to<BR>get the SSR's or not. <BR>BTW the tires are: BFGoodrich 225/ZR60/15's<BR>all the way around.<P>------------------<BR>Dave Gunsul<BR>N.I.F.E. member<BR>86 GT modified<BR>85 SE daily driver||||reg||1
